        <rdfs:comment>Growth and development traits are qualities of the development of the whole plant or plant parts.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:IAO_0000115>A plant trait (TO:0000387) which is the growth (GO:0048590) and development (GO:0032502) of a plant anatomical entity (PO:0025131) or a constituent cellular component (GO:0005575).</ns3:IAO_0000115>
